  "changenote" "3.12：重构共用安装、供电、供水与设备判断框架；按原版家具尺寸划分生活和顶部空间，扩展家具及电器支持；修复车顶灯闪烁与 F700 油桶操作，降低行李架碰撞损耗。 / Refactored the shared framework for installation, power, water supply and equipment checks; classified living and overhead spaces using vanilla furniture dimensions and expanded furniture and appliance support; fixed roof-light flicker and F700 fuel-can operations, and reduced roof-rack collision wear."
